sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-serrata-turing-wavelength-s0> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-serrata-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-serrata-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Drosophila serrata Schnakenberg Turing wavelength at 2.123 µm (Holocene, 0 Ma) — MorphoEval overall 86.4/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Schnakenberg kinetics (a = 0.037, b = 1.146) with Du solved so the band-center wavenumber sits at 2.123 µm. Analytic λ is 2134 nm (sechellia), 2123 nm (serrata, 0 Ma), 2102 nm (silvestris) at fixed Du. RK2 growth rates match the closed form at Pearson r = 0.99998 (RMSE 0.00169). The nonlinear patch selects k/k_c = 0.952. Equal diffusion is stable (σ_max = -0.231). The growth GIF is a radial J0 ocellus in the gallery plate's palette (12 frames, 640×520, CV similarity 94.1). Overall 86.4/100 (faithfulness 85.4, reproducibility 88.8); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 0c76d15d; environment: . Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 88, Morphological realism / specimen match 84, Parameter expressivity 86, Morphometric validation 84, Source and data traceability 92, Code-to-model traceability 86, Reproducibility package 88. Output judged: docs/media/drosophila_serrata_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-drosophila-serrata-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 0c76d15d, image/png, 392984 B, 1344×1008 px, artifact_sha256 8fdd8f2a36c3d99aebfda744943acbb560bc391e8b47885cb22d7c2dc3a02464 (sha256 8fdd8f2a36c3d99aebfda744943acbb560bc391e8b47885cb22d7c2dc3a02464), spec_fingerprint a3c4b3d65dab3b0ebfbf973810a2da1a980cfa0eca08496d6d9c3676418453c9. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: a3c4b3d65dab3b0ebfbf973810a2da1a980cfa0eca08496d6d9c3676418453c9; artifact_sha256: 8fdd8f2a36c3d99aebfda744943acbb560bc391e8b47885cb22d7c2dc3a02464. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Turing 1952 diffusion-driven instability and a finite critical wavenumber | Schnakenberg 1979 trimolecular kinetics | D. serrata CHC cline along the Australian east coast (Frentiu & Chenoweth 2010); reconstructed_in_script: 2.123e-6 m assigned as λ_c for this detail-scale slot | Chronoseries wavelengths 2134 / 2123 / 2102 nm at fixed activator diffusivity | Latitude slope 0.012 mapping cline direction onto δ; transfer_boundary: Gallery plate is the species-gallery fallback, not a measured 2.1 µm micrograph | GIF colors are the plate's luminance-quantile palette; does_not_claim: A published measurement of a 2.123 µm ocellar Turing wavelength in D. serrata | That D. sechellia is the phylogenetic sister of D. serrata." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "open need [independent_assessor/model-fidelity, pressure P=0.0]: Second assessor from another provider has not scored this script.",
            "open need [morphometric_validation/morphometric-validation, pressure P=2.5]: Report k_measured against k_max, the fastest linear mode, not only against band-center k_c.",
            "open need [specimen_comparison/specimen-match, pressure P=1.5]: Figure should state that the gallery scale bar reads 100 µm while the model wavelength is 2.123 µm.",
            "remediation needed: R1: Mark k_max (fastest linear mode) on the dispersion panel and report k_measured/k_max. k/k_c = 0.952 mixes the off-onset shift with FFT lattice quantization.",
            "remediation needed: R2: No second assessor from another provider scored this pass.",
            "remediation needed: R3: Put the 100 µm gallery-bar versus 2.123 µm model-wavelength disclaimer on the comparison figure." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.864"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Grok 4.7 (builder-assessor; second assessor not run)" ;
        dct:identifier "grok-4.7" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> ;
        foaf:homepage <https://x.ai> .
}

